<title>SWEDEN: Stena Line sinks into losses in 9-mo.</title>
<headline>Stena Line sinks into losses in 9-mo.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish ferry company Stena Line reports for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Result after fin items	  LOSS   251  vs    272  PROFIT</p>
<p> Sales					7,070  vs  7,566</p>
<p> Operating costs			  6,549  vs  6,553</p>
<p> Restructuring costs			14   vs     35</p>
<p> Profit pre deprec			 507   vs    978</p>
<p> Depreciation				472   vs    446</p>
<p> Profit after deprec			35   vs    532</p>
<p> Financial income			   22   vs     41</p>
<p> Financial costs			   308   vs    297</p>
<p> Currency difference			 0   vs	4  CHARGE</p>
<p> Net financial items	  CHARGE   286   vs    260  CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax				CREDIT    59   vs    102  CHARGE</p>
<p> Net result			 LOSS   192   vs    170  PROFIT</p>
<p> Share (SKR)				 n/a   vs   2.80</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
